Portions restated in our own selectors, scoped to [data-skin="01"]: the one-colour role derivation (key ink capped for a
light key, the highlighter, the lamp and the glow) and its motion easings from registry/hardware/ui/hardware/tokens.css; the
moulded panel, the hole a cap stands in and its travel, the printed slider scale and the key shadows from
.../hardware-field.css; the gray glass and its print from .../hardware-lcd.css; the tick arc and the pointer from
.../hardware-dials.css; the slot with its detent and the ribbed lever from .../hardware-slide-switch.css; the two-wall
rocker from .../hardware-rocker.css; the segment pitch and glow of the bar graph from .../hardware-bar-graph.css. No file of
theirs is copied: the geometry, the numbers and the shadow layering are, and each ported file says so in its header.
